WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:02.700
Your bank speaks in spreadsheets.

00:02.800 --> 00:06.400
Arca turns them into one number: safe to spend.

00:06.550 --> 00:10.200
Tell it once where a payment belongs, and it remembers.

00:10.300 --> 00:13.950
It looks a month ahead, so nothing catches you out.

00:14.050 --> 00:18.200
All on your own server. No cloud, no tracking.

00:18.300 --> 00:19.300
Arca.

00:19.375 --> 00:22.500
Money, made calm.
